#. 葉隠クンに…見てもらいたい物があるんだ…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Hiro, there's something I'd like you to take a look\n"
"at."
msgstr ""

#. この<CLT 3>ノート<CLT>だよ…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This <CLT 3>notebook<CLT> right here..."
msgstr ""

#. ん？　なんだ、これ…？
#. どうして<CLT 3>俺の名前<CLT>が書いてあるんだ？
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? Hey, why's <CLT 3>my name<CLT> written on it?"
msgstr ""

#. これ…寄宿舎２階のロッカールームで
#. 見つけたんだけどさ…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I found it in the locker room on the 2nd floor."
msgstr ""

#. 中も…確認してもらえる…？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If you don't mind, could you take a look inside?"
msgstr ""

#. 確認も何も…
#. 俺はそんなノートなんて知らんけど…
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Sure, whatever you want. But I've never seen this\n"
"notebook before in my life."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "... ... ..."
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>... ... ...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. およよ？　どうしたん？
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wuzza wuzza? Is something wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そっくり…なんてもんじゃねーべ…
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "It's kinda similar... No, even more than that..."
msgstr ""

#. なんだ、こりゃ！？
#. 丸っきり、俺の字じゃねーか！
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"What the—? This is absolutely my handwriting, without\n"
"a doubt!"
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうして、こんなモンが…？
#. 俺はこんなノートなんて書いた覚え…
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But how is this...? I don't remember ever writing in\n"
"this thing!"
msgstr ""

#. え？　じゃあ、まさか…ッ！
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "N-No... No way!"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠クンは…この希望ヶ峰学園で
#. 授業を受けていたのかもしれない…
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It looks like you actually did attend class here at\n"
"Hope's Peak."
msgstr ""

#. だけど…それを忘れているのかも…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But somehow...you forgot all about it."
msgstr ""

#. ウソだ…ウソだべ……
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Lies... It's all one big lie...!"
msgstr ""

#. 信じられないのは私だって一緒よ。
#. だけど…
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I don't want to believe it either..."
msgstr ""

#. 信じない事には、
#. この手帳の説明も付かないわ。
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But there's also no explanation for this pocketbook."
msgstr ""

#. …ん？　誰の手帳？
msgctxt "0019 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Hm... And whose pocketbook is that?"
msgstr ""

#. 私の手帳よ。ここに書き込まれていたのも、
#. 間違いなく私の字だったわ。
msgctxt "0020 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's mine. And the handwriting inside is also mine,\n"
"there's no doubt about it."
msgstr ""

#. だけど…私は何も覚えていない…
#. 葉隠君と同じようにね…
msgctxt "0021 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But just like Hiro, I have no memory of ever writing\n"
"in it."
msgstr ""

#. その理由が…空白の２年間…？
msgctxt "0022 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And the reason for that...is the two years of missing\n"
"memories?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ、そんな証拠まで出てきたら、
#. そろそろ認めるしかないんじゃない？
msgctxt "0023 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu. After seeing all the evidence, do you have any\n"
"choice but to acknowledge the truth?"
msgstr ""

#. つーか、絶望的に暗くね？
#. 謎が解けた割に、お通夜的な雰囲気じゃね？
msgctxt "0024 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Isn't it just so desperately dark? The mystery's\n"
"solved, but it's like a goddamn funeral in here!"
msgstr ""

#. つって、お通夜なんか出た事ねーんだけどなぁ！
#. イエス！！
msgctxt "0025 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Shit man, I've never been to a funeral. Hell yes!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ２年間の学生生活…
#. そこには色んな青春があったはずだよ？
msgctxt "0027 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Two years of school life. How many moments of\n"
"blossoming youth have you missed out on?"
msgstr ""

#. 楽しい授業や、胸躍る学校行事…
#. そこで互いに親交を深め合ったりしたはずだよ？
msgctxt "0028 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"How many fun classes? How many school events? This was\n"
"your chance to build lasting friendships, right?"
msgstr ""

#. さらに、ちょうど１年前には、
#. とっても悲しい事件も起きたっけ…
msgctxt "0029 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And on top of that, something tragically sad happened\n"
"one year ago..."
msgstr ""

#. そう、人類史上最大最悪の絶望的事件だよ。
msgctxt "0030 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"The biggest, most awful, most tragic event in human\n"
"history."
msgstr ""

#. そして、みなさんの目の前で、
#. 世界は終わってしまったんだ…
msgctxt "0031 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Right before everyone's eyes, the world came crashing\n"
"down..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、そんな絶望もひっくるめて、
#. みなさんはすべてを忘れた…
msgctxt "0032 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You absorbed all that despair, but then you forgot it\n"
"all."
msgstr ""

#. すべてを忘れた上で、
#. このコロシアイ学園生活に挑んでいたんだ。
msgctxt "0033 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And once you'd forgotten, you made the choice to\n"
"subject yourselves to this killing game."
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、もう１つ教えてあげるよ。
#. 正確に言うならば、みなさんの記憶が失われたのは…
msgctxt "0034 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Oh, and there's one other thing. To be even more\n"
"precise, the memories you all lost were..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0035 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 駄目です…飽き飽きです…
#. 説明する事に飽きてしまいました…
msgctxt "0036 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Actually, never mind. I'm bored. Explaining stuff is\n"
"boring..."
msgstr ""

#. は…？
msgctxt "0037 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "Cái gì...?"

#. 私様は、この世界に飽き飽きしているのよ。
msgctxt "0038 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "We are bored of this world!"
msgstr ""

#. 誰もが挑戦的で新しい物を欲しているように言いつつ、
#. 結局、ありふれた物しか手に入れようとしない…
msgctxt "0039 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Everyone always talks big, declaring all the great\n"
"things they'll do! But then they always fizzle out..."
msgstr ""

#. なんつー、絶望的に退屈な世界だよ！！
msgctxt "0040 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "This world is just so desperately fucking boring!"
msgstr ""

#. なんの話を…しているの…？
msgctxt "0041 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What are you talking about?"
msgstr "Thật là, cậu đang nói gì thế hả?"

#. アタシはね…ある意味、
#. みなさんに羨望すら感じているんだ。
msgctxt "0042 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "In a way, I'm jealous of all of you."
msgstr ""

#. こんなに刺激的な絶望に、
#. 身を委ねられるなんてさ…
msgctxt "0043 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"To give yourself over so completely to such\n"
"stimulating despair..."
msgstr ""

#. だから、後はオメェらで勝手に考えろ！！
#. オレは説明に飽きちまったんだよッ！
msgctxt "0044 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Yeah, so figure out the rest for yourselves! I'm sick\n"
"of expositioning all this shit!"
msgstr ""

#. か、考えろって…何を…？
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Figure out...what?"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、あなた方の<CLT 3>記憶の接合点<CLT>はどこにあるのか…
#. そういう事です。
msgctxt "0046 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Figure out <CLT 3>where your memories come apart<CLT>. That's at\n"
"the heart of all of this."
msgstr ""

#. 気を失った時
msgctxt "0047 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "When I fainted"
msgstr ""

#. 入学式の時
msgctxt "0048 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "At the entrance ceremony"
msgstr ""

#. 入学式の時に、
#. モノクマがみんなを集めたよね…
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Monokuma gathered us all together for the entrance\n"
"ceremony..."
msgstr ""

#. きっとその時、
#. モノクマが何かをしてみんな一斉に…
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"When we got together, Monokuma must have done\n"
"something to us all at once."
msgstr ""

#. …本当にそうかしら？
msgctxt "0051 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Are you sure about that?"
msgstr ""

#. 私には、あの前後で記憶が途絶えた感覚はないわ。
msgctxt "0052 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I don't recall any sensation of having my memories\n"
"interrupted at that point."
msgstr ""

#. 入学式直前のモノクマの校内放送の不快感だって、
#. 今もはっきり覚えているわよ。
msgctxt "0053 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I still remember the anxiety of hearing his\n"
"announcement before the ceremony began."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>言われてみれば、
#. あの時にそんな感覚はなかった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now that you mention it, I don't remember that\n"
"sensation of loss then, either...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも…
#. その少し前に変な感覚を味わったはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I'm sure I felt that sensation at some point...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 入学通知を見た時
msgctxt "0057 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "When I got my acceptance letter"
msgstr ""

#. あの入学通知だ…！
#. きっと、あれに何か仕掛けがしてあったんだ…！！
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's it! It must have something to do with the\n"
"acceptance letters!"
msgstr ""

#. 何か薬品が付着してたとか、
#. 通知内容に暗示をかけるような部分があったとか！
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"They were laced with some kind of chemical, or\n"
"enchanted with some kind of hypnosis spell!"
msgstr ""

#. 俺は入学通知など触りもしなければ、
#. 見てもいない。
msgctxt "0060 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But I never touched my acceptance letter. I never even\n"
"saw it, in fact."
msgstr ""

#. ええっ！！　そうなの！？
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What? Seriously!?"
msgstr "Cái gì!? Nghiêm túc hả!?"

#. わずらわしい事は、
#. すべて執事が行っている…
msgctxt "0062 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I have a servant to handle minor inconveniences like\n"
"that."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そう…
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Oh..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>えーっと…
#. 他にあやしいのって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... There was one other suspicious thing...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなと顔を合わす直前の…
#. あの事か…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe that time...right before I met everyone else...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. …自分で考えなよ。
msgctxt "0067 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Better figure it out. I'm not gonna do it for ya!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0068 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu..."
msgstr "U pư pư..."

#. <CLT 4>記憶を失った瞬間…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The moment my memory cut out...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、この学園に来た直後のあの時…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Could it be that moment, right after arriving at\n"
"Hope's Peak...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>記憶の接合点…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Where our memories come apart...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって、ボク達が記憶を失った瞬間…
#. その事を言ってるのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is she talking about the moment where we must have\n"
"lost our memories?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>記憶の接合点…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Where our memories come apart...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって、ボク達が記憶を失った瞬間…
#. その事を言ってるのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is she talking about the moment where we must have\n"
"lost our memories?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>考えられるのって、あの時しかないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can only think of one time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最初に玄関ホールに入った直後…
#. そこで…ボクに起きた事…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just after I set foot in the main hall for the\n"
"first time. And that was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
